  "description": "Alex, vengeful Elf is on a vendetta against the so-called \"Chosen ones\" who keep the peace of the land ever since their ancestors vanquished the Dark Lord Gob-Khan a millennia ago.\nSeeking to destroy the world that has betrayed her, Alex awakens the Dark Lord from his thousand-year-old slumber only to find that a goblin.\nWill this pathetic little green creature manage to live up to his seemingly unjustified reputation and help Alex bring apocalypse upon the world? \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
